<title>JAPAN: Nihon Seikan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Seikan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.70		vs	    4.00</p>
<p> Operating    loss 76 million	 vs    loss 22 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 107 million	 vs    loss 53 million</p>
<p> Net		   71 million	 vs	   56 million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.63 yen	  vs	    4.47 yen</p>
<p> Shares		13 million	 vs	   13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	--		    vs	  --</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Seikan Co Ltd is a medium-scale can maker specialising in nonsoldered cans.</p>
